<<<
HACKNEYED PHRASES. When Punch set down
===
**HACKNEYED PHRASES.** When *Punch* set down
>>>

<<<
‘ don’t? without
===
‘ don't ’ without
>>>

<<<
unaccompanied by “harmless necessary’; nay
===
unaccompanied by ‘ harmless necessary ’; nay
>>>

<<<
the cat, ‘ harmless’ still
===
the cat, ‘ harmless ’ still
>>>

<<<
as ‘e pur si muove’ was
===
as ‘ e pur si muove ’ was
>>>

<<<
her long arm has . doubtless suffered
===
her long arm has doubtless suffered
>>>

<<<
hackneyed phrases are counted | by the hundred, & those registered | below are a mere selection.
===
hackneyed phrases are counted by the hundred, & those registered below are a mere selection.
>>>

<<<
for him, the | freshness of novelty
===
for him, the freshness of novelty
>>>

<<<
giving a fillip te a passage
===
giving a fillip to a passage
>>>

<<<
they do serve this | purpose with some readers
===
they do serve this purpose with some readers
>>>

<<<
readers—the less discerning—, though with the | other kind
===
readers—the less discerning—, though with the other kind
>>>

<<<
he & all of us have our likes & our | dislikes
===
